{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6358a38382a4254f1b4d9fa3a7c96b286779ba1f6d67a6d8740752dc6866ba7d",
      "text": "F-LAGS的各位，\n今天一整天，请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b920400ee6a4a2cd3286e166eee717e1cd308ce46ece2746e8449fc35a7dedf5",
      "text": "请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0c6677edb97dd77be851189e1d49b2c682bf18ece2a4449ff6ff7056106c33",
      "text": "那么事不宜迟，请允许我重新为各位\n说明一下今天的拍摄内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf299b0e7ddf95b78ac018463089924034617d3003bfcd95ff96373f58516bca",
      "text": "首先在前瞻环节，我们会拍摄各位\n游玩《With...STORY》时的画面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c60bc9c259e968e79b1ef759e562d6d911052dd00eff446ce9e2b9b8b43156",
      "text": "后半部分则是会请各位逐一录制\n实际游玩过后的感想留言。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1da48b8a14abe90085ac212197fcd53851b7dc927fde9f46991c44c91d35d77b",
      "text": "明白了！\n拍摄中说的话，基本上是自由发挥对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a96dcd01403263d50024bce2ca70b528308d81d3dbe5bceb2d4b4e3bafea9df0",
      "text": "是的。虽然有简单的流程台本，\n但基本上畅所欲言就可以了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9b393495ba9f26e9017b491a1b429fef37a44421072e28655398c810b907907",
      "text": "…原来如此。也就是说，展现自然的状态就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:102a9598528f99d0ee6d919550f2a398e839e920c3ff6ea37d89ee61f7c7a4d9",
      "text": "哇哈哈！这样对俺们来说，\n反而更放得开呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51832bc1fefbb6f932ff61c50c23854ccf2f741533a96e0077e66391fa32ca95",
      "text": "就尽情去享受游戏，\n让大家拍下我们满分的笑容吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
